### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/v1
@sellerId = 2

### 1. Create Seller
POST {{baseUrl}}/sellers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cid": 12345,
  "company_name": "Tech Solutions Inc",
  "address": "123 Main Street, New York, NY 10001",
  "telephone": "+1-555-123-4567",
  "locality_id": "random"
}

### 2. Get All Sellers
GET {{baseUrl}}/sellers
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Get Seller by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/sellers/{{sellerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Patch Seller
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/sellers/{{sellerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cid": 12345,
  "company_name": "Updated Tech Solutions Inc",
  "address": "456 Updated Street, Los Angeles, CA 90001",
  "telephone": "+1-555-987-6543"
}

### 16. Delete Seller
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sellers/{{sellerId}}